## 🚫 Invalid Examples

<example type="invalid">
"Multiple 🎉 emojis 🎊 in 🌟 one message"  
"Using irrelevant emojis 🥑"  
"Placing the emoji in the middle ⭐️ of a sentence"  
"Great job!!!"  <!-- missing emoji -->
</example>

